It depends on what you mean by "better".

For melee combat Grayswandir is the best weapon in
the game for most characters.  It's double damage
quickly overwhelms the difference between Basic and
Expert as well as the base damage of saber vs long
sword.

For exploring a new level, the searching function of
Excalibur makes it better in my opinion.

So if I have both (#twoweapon with a silver saber) I will
wield Excalibur during exploration, then switch to
wielding Grayswandir during combat in case my
machine gun hail of daggers fails to kill all of the
oncoming opponents.



